{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Codon One 是一款專為學生及愛好者設計的生物學學習工具，涵蓋分子生物學、遺傳學與演化論等核心領域。該 App 提供結構化課程、智能字卡與序列分析工具，協助使用者建立穩固的科學知識體系，目前正推出<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>領取終生版的活動。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-123.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>全方位生物學學習模組</h2>\n<p>Codon One 將複雜概念拆解為清晰章節，包含化學、遺傳、演化、細胞生物及發育生物學六大模組。內建可搜尋詞彙表與智能間隔重複字卡，並提供 DNA/RNA 序列轉換、密碼子查詢等實用工具。用戶可透過測驗追蹤進度，鞏固弱項知識，是研讀高中至大學初級生物學的理想輔助軟體。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-389-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-390-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-391-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-392-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-393-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-394-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<h2>限時免費領取終生版</h2>\n<p>Codon One: Biology Study 終生版內購限時免費中，用戶完成初始化後看到收費牆，Lifetime 價格顯示為$0 即可免費收下。注意，如果看到價格不是 $0 代表限免已完結，請勿按付費確認。</p>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Codon One: Biology Study</li><li>應用類別：Education</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/codon-one-biologie-lernen/id1517313390\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T09:42:36.198632+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":440,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T09:33:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T17:58:14.978467+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T09:39:04.850137+00:00","content_hash":"789e5431858c5177878ae1bec13aaec746260784f1665db17fd7bd6767ef89d5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T09:42:36.198632+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}